{"v":4,"catch":"毀滅了世界的惡魔，為了打倒他。\n一個獵人站了出來。","desc":"◆故事\n世界曾是安逸和平的﹐直到被毀滅的那天…\n通往地獄的門扉被開啟﹐所有生物都陷入瘋狂並轉化成惡魔\n你將成為終止所有元凶的獵人，直面這個瘋狂世界吧!\n◆系統\n高難度的通關動作遊戲\n收集大量的愛心並自由操作副武器來擊敗敵人吧!\n\n此遊戲是由Maker系列中專門製作動作遊戲的軟體「Pixel Game Maker MV」所製作。此遊戲系列均能在Nintendo Switch™上遊玩。","publisher":"Gotcha Gotcha Games","release":"2024-02-01","genres":["街機","動作","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ab9145567865e0f9a8fedc9be997b6cf1539e41d366f7148084995b4c53460d0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54c546c3040373c6cb03af58827531e261995c4bc72c252bbff423944b63cf9b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f7cad15fc711d3917d1f639c5c76cbdab56b530e739b7eaf9960a3b299bab4bb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/70c110dff77428902e335f67fb620a657ab91d96cde6b202d4e74c5eb341fbf7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/393357e62bf958f7e20b1b22648d1d0d78ca22290da8e78406670df172b32a71.jpg"],"titleId":"010091b01d444000","dlc":[]}